    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小車們還在準備繼續攻擊我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不想傷害他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "怎麼會一靠近這片區域就突然失控了——\n等等，停下，Friston-3！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "首先，我不會像那幾個傢伙一樣撞你們，或者向你們噴火——我一切正常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "speakerId": "avg_4093_frston_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，讓我過去，時間很趕，我的耐心很有限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
